$$ \frac{1}{3}\sin t + \cos t = \sqrt{\frac{1}{3} + 1} \left(\frac{\frac{1}{3}}{\sqrt{\frac{1}{3} + 1}} \sin t + \frac{1}{\sqrt{\frac{1}{3} + 1}} \cos t\right) $$
